  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あるアスリートが　かいぞうされたすがただと　オカルトざっしがスクープした　サイボーグに　ちかい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어떤 운동선수를 개조한 모습이라며 오컬트 잡지에서 대서특필했던 사이보그와 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "長相近似於超自然雜誌以頭條來報導的某運動選手被改造成生化人後的樣子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à l’athlète transformé en cyborg dont l’histoire avait été révélée en exclusivité dans une revue sur les phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt stark einem Cyborg, der laut einer Sonderausgabe einer esoterischen Zeitschrift die modifizierte Form eines gewissen Athleten ist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda parecido con un atleta, supuestamente transformado en cíborg, que apareció entre las exclusivas de una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo aspetto è simile a quello di un atleta che, stando allo scoop di una rivista di paranormale, sarebbe stato trasformato in un cyborg.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is very similar to a cyborg covered exclusively by a paranormal magazine. The cyborg was said to be the modified form of a certain athlete.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あるアスリートが　改造された姿だと　オカルト雑誌がスクープした　サイボーグに　近い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "与超自然杂志曾独家报道过的某运动员被改造成机械生化人的样子很相似。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda parecido con un atleta, supuestamente transformado en cíborg, que apareció entre las exclusivas de una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あるたんけんきに　しるされたテツノカイナという　ぶったいとにたてんが　おおい　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "어느 탐험기에 기록된 “무쇠손”이라는 물체와 닮은 점이 많은 포켓몬.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與某本探險記裡記載的一種叫做鐵臂膀的物體有許多相似處的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon présente de nombreuses similitudes avec une entité nommée « Paume-de-Fer », qui figure dans un certain récit d’exploration.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon weist viele Ähnlichkeiten mit einem Objekt namens Eisenhand auf, das in einem gewissen Expeditionsbericht erwähnt wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon comparte muchas características con Ferropalmas, un objeto descrito en cierto diario.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha molti aspetti in comune con Manoferrea, un oggetto menzionato in un certo diario di viaggio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon shares many similarities with Iron Hands, an object mentioned in a certain expedition journal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ある探検記に　記されたテツノカイナという　物体と似た点が　多い　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "这种宝可梦与某本探险记中记载的一种叫做铁臂膀的物体有许多相似之处。",
      "language": {
